repository-code: "https://github.com/getHarshOnline/gazette"
url: "https://rawthoughts.in/gazette"
abstract: >-
  Gazette publishes a body of thought from the whole to its parts. It is a
  publishing compiler that turns authored content and a workspace's
  publication structure into websites, with collections, journeys and
  crossings between publications declared once and carried into HTML,
  navigation, search, feeds, JSON-LD and llms.txt.
keywords:
  - publishing-compiler
  - semantic-publishing
  - publication-graph
  - structured-data
  - documentation
